  "description": "Hershe is a brave hero who saves Princess Mel when she's kidnapped and taken to the demon world. Once the king assigns Hershe to Mel as her bodyguard, they fall in love. But because their kingdom is weak, Mel is fated to be married off to a powerful emperor and treated like a hostage. So Hershe sets out on the king's orders to bring back the demon king's sword and bolster the kingdom's military power. Although Hershe is determined to save Mel, can she thwart the demon king's mind games that try to use her desires against her?.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of Ridi's Jujonggwangye GL Danpyeonseon (주종관계 GL 단편선) Collection.*",
